erests to only have successful campaigns. But if there were a way to determine which campaigns would be extremely successful \u2013 and could theoretically be even more successful with the right publicity on their end \u2013 Kickstarter would find this information extremely valuable. We could also provide a service to a prospective user of a crowdfunding campaign, on ways that they can optimize their campaign itself to give themselves the best chance of being successful.","topics":[],"score":1798.4,"global_rank":408141},{"name":"ashishakonnur/YouTube-trends-for-2017-2018---Intro-to-Python","owner":"ashishakonnur","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishakonnur/YouTube-trends-for-2017-2018---Intro-to-Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1798.4,"global_rank":408142},{"name":"swordman08/EC2-Shiny-Help","owner":"swordman08","html_url":"https://github.com/swordman08/EC2-Shiny-Help","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Tutorial for classmates having trouble running there shiny app on EC2 instance.","topics":[],"score":1798.4,"global_rank":408143},{"name":"CharlesPoletowin/data-pipeline","owner":"CharlesPoletowin","html_url":"https://github.com/CharlesPoletowin/data-pipeline","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"a project in INESA","topics":[],"score":1798.4,"global_rank":408144},{"name":"Yosolita1978/week11ContactApp","owner":"Yosolita1978","html_url":"https://github.com/Yosolita1978/week11ContactApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1798.4,"global_rank":408145},{"name":"rkamradt/storage-deploy","owner":"rkamradt","html_url":"https://github.com/rkamradt/storage-deploy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Deploying a Rook/EdgeFS system to Kubernetes","topics":[],"score":1798.4,"global_rank":408146},{"name":"WINNER0